{\rtf1\ansi\deff0{\fonttbl{\f0 Aptos;}{\f1 Consolas;}}\paperw11907\paperh16840\margl1134\margr1134\margt850\margb850\viewkind4\uc1\pard\qc\f0\fs36\b K\u7882?CH B\u7842?N TR\u204?NH B\u192?Y AI HR HELPDESK\b0\par\pard\qc\fs24 Th\u7901?i l\u432?\u7907?ng: 25 ph\u250?t - Kh\u244?ng bao g\u7891?m Q&A\par\pard\qc\fs20 Gemini 2.5 Flash + Hybrid RAG\par\par\pard\ql\fs21 Nguy\u234?n t\u7855?c: n\u243?i theo \u253?, kh\u244?ng \u273?\u7885?c nguy\u234?n v\u259?n slide. C\u225?c c\u226?u d\u432?\u7899?i \u273?\u226?y l\u224? talk track \u273?\u7875? luy\u7879?n t\u7853?p.\par\par\pard\keepn\sb220\sa100\fs27\b 00:00 - 01:00 | M\u7903? \u273?\u7847?u\b0\par\pard\li360\fi-220\sa100\fs22 \u8226? Em xin gi\u7899?i thi\u7879?u pet project AI HR Helpdesk - tr\u7907? l\u253? h\u7887?i \u273?\u225?p ch\u237?nh s\u225?ch nh\u226?n s\u7921? s\u7917? d\u7909?ng Gemini 2.5 Flash k\u7871?t h\u7907?p Hybrid RAG.\par\pard\li360\fi-220\sa100\fs22 \u8226? B\u224?i to\u225?n em ch\u7885?n xu\u7845?t ph\u225?t t\u7915? vi\u7879?c c\u225?c c\u226?u h\u7887?i nh\u432? ngh\u7881? ph\u233?p, ch\u7845?m c\u244?ng, b\u7843?o hi\u7875?m v\u224? l\u432?\u417?ng th\u432?\u7903?ng th\u432?\u7901?ng l\u7863?p l\u7841?i, trong khi th\u244?ng tin n\u7857?m r\u7843?i r\u225?c \u7903? nhi\u7873?u t\u224?i li\u7879?u.\par\pard\li360\fi-220\sa100\fs22 \u8226? Em kh\u244?ng mu\u7889?n x\u226?y m\u7897?t chatbot ch\u7881? g\u7885?i LLM r\u7891?i tr\u7843? l\u7901?i theo ki\u7871?n th\u7913?c c\u243? s\u7861?n. M\u7909?c ti\u234?u l\u224? h\u7879? th\u7889?ng ph\u7843?i tr\u7843? l\u7901?i theo t\u224?i li\u7879?u n\u7897?i b\u7897?, bi\u7871?t h\u7887?i l\u7841?i khi thi\u7871?u d\u7919? ki\u7879?n, b\u7843?o v\u7879? d\u7919? li\u7879?u c\u225? nh\u226?n v\u224? chuy\u7875?n HR x\u7917? l\u253? khi g\u7863?p tr\u432?\u7901?ng h\u7907?p nh\u7841?y c\u7843?m.\par\pard\keepn\sb220\sa100\fs27\b 01:00 - 03:00 | \u7912?ng d\u7909?ng l\u224?m \u273?\u432?\u7907?c g\u236??\b0\par\pard\li360\fi-220\sa100\fs22 \u8226? H\u7879? th\u7889?ng c\u243? ba nh\u243?m ng\u432?\u7901?i d\u249?ng: nh\u226?n vi\u234?n, HR v\u224? admin.\par\pard\li360\fi-220\sa100\fs22 \u8226? Nh\u226?n vi\u234?n c\u243? th\u7875? h\u7887?i ch\u237?nh s\u225?ch b\u7857?ng ng\u244?n ng\u7919? t\u7921? nhi\u234?n, t\u7841?o \u273?\u417?n ngh\u7881? qua nhi\u7873?u l\u432?\u7907?t h\u7897?i tho\u7841?i, theo d\u245?i y\u234?u c\u7847?u v\u224? chuy\u7875?n sang chat tr\u7921?c ti\u7871?p v\u7899?i HR.\par\pard\li360\fi-220\sa100\fs22 \u8226? HR c\u243? th\u7875? ti\u7871?p nh\u7853?n c\u225?c tr\u432?\u7901?ng h\u7907?p chatbot kh\u244?ng n\u234?n t\u7921? quy\u7871?t \u273?\u7883?nh, x\u7917? l\u253? y\u234?u c\u7847?u v\u224? c\u7853?p nh\u7853?t t\u224?i li\u7879?u ch\u237?nh s\u225?ch.\par\pard\li360\fi-220\sa100\fs22 \u8226? Admin qu\u7843?n l\u253? t\u224?i kho\u7843?n, ph\u226?n quy\u7873?n v\u224? ngu\u7891?n d\u7919? li\u7879?u c\u7911?a RAG.\par\pard\li360\fi-220\sa100\fs22 \u8226? Ngo\u224?i m\u224?n H\u7887?i \u273?\u225?p th\u244?ng minh, \u7913?ng d\u7909?ng c\u243? chatbot nh\u7887? xu\u7845?t hi\u7879?n \u7903? c\u225?c m\u224?n kh\u225?c. Hai giao di\u7879?n d\u249?ng chung l\u7883?ch s\u7917?, ng\u7919? c\u7843?nh v\u224? tr\u7841?ng th\u225?i lu\u7891?ng t\u7841?o \u273?\u417?n.\par\pard\li360\fi-220\sa100\fs22 \u8226? \u272?i\u7875?m em mu\u7889?n nh\u7845?n m\u7841?nh l\u224? \u273?\u226?y kh\u244?ng ph\u7843?i chatbot \u273?\u7913?ng ri\u234?ng, m\u224? l\u224? m\u7897?t ph\u7847?n c\u7911?a quy tr\u236?nh HR Helpdesk.\par\pard\keepn\sb220\sa100\fs27\b 03:00 - 04:00 | Show giao di\u7879?n\b0\par\pard\li360\fi-220\sa100\fs22 \u8226? \u272?\u226?y l\u224? giao di\u7879?n \u273?ang ch\u7841?y th\u7921?c t\u7871?, kh\u244?ng ph\u7843?i mockup.\par\pard\li360\fi-220\sa100\fs22 \u8226? Ph\u7847?n h\u7897?i tho\u7841?i \u273?\u432?\u7907?c thi\u7871?t k\u7871? theo h\u432?\u7899?ng ng\u432?\u7901?i d\u249?ng cu\u7889?i, kh\u244?ng hi\u7875?n th\u7883? log k\u7929? thu\u7853?t ho\u7863?c t\u234?n dataset.\par\pard\li360\fi-220\sa100\fs22 \u8226? Giao di\u7879?n \u273?\u227? \u273?\u432?\u7907?c ki\u7875?m tra responsive t\u7915? chi\u7873?u r\u7897?ng 320 pixel. \u212? nh\u7853?p lu\u244?n n\u7857?m trong viewport v\u224? kh\u244?ng b\u7883? nh\u7843?y sau khi g\u7917?i tin nh\u7855?n.\par\pard\li360\fi-220\sa100\fs22 \u8226? Khi chuy\u7875?n gi\u7919?a chatbot nh\u7887? v\u224? m\u224?n chat \u273?\u7847?y \u273?\u7911?, l\u7883?ch s\u7917? v\u224? lu\u7891?ng \u273?ang x\u7917? l\u253? v\u7851?n \u273?\u432?\u7907?c gi\u7919? nguy\u234?n theo t\u224?i kho\u7843?n.\par\pard\keepn\sb220\sa100\fs27\b 04:00 - 06:00 | Ki\u7871?n tr\u250?c t\u7893?ng th\u7875?\b0\par\pard\li360\fi-220\sa100\fs22 \u8226? Frontend \u273?\u432?\u7907?c x\u226?y b\u7857?ng React v\u224? Vite. Frontend g\u7885?i FastAPI \u273?\u7875? x\u7917? l\u253? authentication, ph\u226?n quy\u7873?n, upload t\u224?i li\u7879?u, nghi\u7879?p v\u7909? HR v\u224? chat.\par\pard\li360\fi-220\sa100\fs22 \u8226? Khi c\u243? c\u226?u h\u7887?i, backend ch\u7841?y lu\u7891?ng g\u7891?m screening intent, query rewrite, retrieval, l\u7885?c RBAC, validation v\u224? generation.\par\pard\li360\fi-220\sa100\fs22 \u8226? Retrieval k\u7871?t h\u7907?p semantic search v\u224? BM25. K\u7871?t qu\u7843? \u273?\u432?\u7907?c h\u7907?p nh\u7845?t b\u7857?ng RRF, rerank v\u224? l\u7885?c theo ch\u7911? \u273?\u7873? tr\u432?\u7899?c khi \u273?\u432?a v\u224?o Gemini.\par\pard\li360\fi-220\sa100\fs22 \u8226? T\u224?i li\u7879?u \u273?\u432?\u7907?c tr\u237?ch xu\u7845?t th\u224?nh Markdown, chia chunk, t\u7841?o embedding v\u224? l\u432?u v\u224?o Chroma. M\u7897?t JSON index ri\u234?ng \u273?\u432?\u7907?c d\u249?ng cho BM25.\par\pard\li360\fi-220\sa100\fs22 \u8226? \u272?i\u7875?m quan tr\u7885?ng l\u224? quy\u7873?n truy c\u7853?p \u273?\u432?\u7907?c l\u7885?c tr\u432?\u7899?c khi context \u273?\u432?\u7907?c \u273?\u432?a v\u224?o LLM.\par\pard\keepn\sb220\sa100\fs27\b 06:00 - 10:00 | Technique \u273?\u227? ch\u7885?n v\u224? pros/cons\b0\par\pard\li360\fi-220\sa100\fs22 \u8226? Gemini 2.5 Flash: Em ch\u7885?n v\u236? t\u7889?c \u273?\u7897? ph\u7843?n h\u7891?i t\u7889?t, h\u7895? tr\u7907? ti\u7871?ng Vi\u7879?t \u7893?n v\u224? chi ph\u237? ph\u249? h\u7907?p v\u7899?i pet project. Nh\u432?\u7907?c \u273?i\u7875?m l\u224? ph\u7909? thu\u7897?c v\u224?o m\u7841?ng v\u224? provider, n\u234?n c\u225?c guardrail quan tr\u7885?ng v\u224? fallback kh\u244?ng ph\u7909? thu\u7897?c ho\u224?n to\u224?n v\u224?o LLM.\par\pard\li360\fi-220\sa100\fs22 \u8226? Dense search k\u7871?t h\u7907?p BM25: Dense search hi\u7875?u c\u226?u h\u7887?i t\u7921? nhi\u234?n v\u224? c\u225?ch di\u7877?n \u273?\u7841?t kh\u225?c t\u224?i li\u7879?u. BM25 m\u7841?nh v\u7899?i t\u7915? kh\u243?a ch\u237?nh x\u225?c, m\u227? ch\u237?nh s\u225?ch ho\u7863?c thu\u7853?t ng\u7919? HR. \u431?u \u273?i\u7875?m l\u224? t\u259?ng recall; nh\u432?\u7907?c \u273?i\u7875?m l\u224? pipeline ph\u7913?c t\u7841?p h\u417?n v\u224? c\u7847?n tune ranking.\par\pard\li360\fi-220\sa100\fs22 \u8226? Atomic chunking: Chunk nh\u7887? gi\u250?p gi\u7843?m nhi\u7877?u v\u224? b\u225?m s\u225?t \u273?i\u7873?u kho\u7843?n. Nh\u432?\u7907?c \u273?i\u7875?m l\u224? c\u243? th\u7875? m\u7845?t ng\u7919? c\u7843?nh. Em gi\u7843?m r\u7911?i ro b\u7857?ng c\u225?ch chia theo heading, l\u7863?p heading context v\u224? s\u7917? d\u7909?ng overlap.\par\pard\li360\fi-220\sa100\fs22 \u8226? RRF v\u224? reranking: RRF h\u7907?p nh\u7845?t k\u7871?t qu\u7843? dense v\u224? sparse m\u224? kh\u244?ng y\u234?u c\u7847?u hai lo\u7841?i score c\u243? c\u249?ng thang \u273?o. Reranking gi\u250?p t\u259?ng precision c\u7911?a top-k. \u272?\u7893?i l\u7841?i, h\u7879? th\u7889?ng c\u243? th\u234?m latency v\u224? chi ph\u237? t\u237?nh to\u225?n.\par\pard\li360\fi-220\sa100\fs22 \u8226? LangGraph: \u431?u \u273?i\u7875?m l\u224? c\u225?c b\u432?\u7899?c allow, clarify, block, retrieve v\u224? generate \u273?\u432?\u7907?c th\u7875? hi\u7879?n r\u245?, d\u7877? ki\u7875?m so\u225?t. Nh\u432?\u7907?c \u273?i\u7875?m l\u224? c\u243? nhi\u7873?u state v\u224? node h\u417?n code tuy\u7871?n t\u237?nh.\par\pard\li360\fi-220\sa100\fs22 \u8226? Chroma local: Ph\u249? h\u7907?p \u273?\u7875? tri\u7875?n khai pilot nhanh v\u224? kh\u244?ng c\u7847?n v\u7853?n h\u224?nh h\u7841? t\u7847?ng ri\u234?ng. Nh\u432?\u7907?c \u273?i\u7875?m l\u224? ch\u432?a ph\u7843?i l\u7921?a ch\u7885?n t\u7889?i \u432?u cho high availability ho\u7863?c d\u7919? li\u7879?u enterprise r\u7845?t l\u7899?n.\par\pard\li360\fi-220\sa100\fs22 \u8226? Kh\u244?ng c\u243? technique n\u224?o t\u7889?t tuy\u7879?t \u273?\u7889?i. Em ch\u7885?n d\u7921?a tr\u234?n s\u7921? c\u226?n b\u7857?ng gi\u7919?a ch\u7845?t l\u432?\u7907?ng, t\u7889?c \u273?\u7897?, chi ph\u237? v\u224? ph\u7841?m vi c\u7911?a pet project.\par\pard\keepn\sb220\sa100\fs27\b 10:00 - 12:00 | Logic h\u7897?i tho\u7841?i v\u224? guardrail\b0\par\pard\li360\fi-220\sa100\fs22 \u8226? Chatbot kh\u244?ng ch\u7881? nh\u7853?n m\u7897?t c\u226?u r\u7891?i tr\u7843? l\u7901?i m\u7897?t l\u7847?n. N\u7871?u ng\u432?\u7901?i d\u249?ng mu\u7889?n ngh\u7881? nh\u432?ng ch\u432?a c\u243? ng\u224?y, bot h\u7887?i ng\u224?y. Khi c\u243? ng\u224?y, bot h\u7887?i l\u253? do v\u224? b\u224?n giao. Khi \u273?\u7911? d\u7919? li\u7879?u, bot d\u7921?ng form \u273?\u7875? ng\u432?\u7901?i d\u249?ng ki\u7875?m tra tr\u432?\u7899?c khi g\u7917?i HR.\par\pard\li360\fi-220\sa100\fs22 \u8226? C\u225?c c\u226?u ng\u7855?n nh\u432? ok, hi\u7875?u r\u7891?i, c\u7843?m \u417?n ho\u7863?c kh\u244?ng c\u7847?n n\u7919?a \u273?\u432?\u7907?c x\u7917? l\u253? \u7903? conversation layer, kh\u244?ng \u273?\u432?a v\u224?o RAG v\u224? kh\u244?ng l\u224?m chatbot t\u7921? gi\u7899?i thi\u7879?u l\u7841?i.\par\pard\li360\fi-220\sa100\fs22 \u8226? C\u226?u thi\u7871?u ng\u7919? c\u7843?nh \u273?\u432?\u7907?c chuy\u7875?n sang clarify. C\u226?u ngo\u224?i ph\u7841?m vi ho\u7863?c y\u234?u c\u7847?u secret b\u7883? block.\par\pard\li360\fi-220\sa100\fs22 \u8226? Y\u234?u c\u7847?u l\u432?\u417?ng ho\u7863?c h\u7891? s\u417? c\u7911?a ng\u432?\u7901?i kh\u225?c b\u7883? t\u7915? ch\u7889?i r\u245? r\u224?ng. Tranh ch\u7845?p, k\u7927? lu\u7853?t v\u224? khi\u7871?u n\u7841?i \u273?\u432?\u7907?c h\u432?\u7899?ng chuy\u7875?n ti\u7871?p HR.\par\pard\keepn\sb220\sa100\fs27\b 12:00 - 14:00 | C\u225?ch em \u273?\u7885?c v\u224? hi\u7875?u code\b0\par\pard\li360\fi-220\sa100\fs22 \u8226? Khi \u273?\u7885?c code, em \u273?i theo lu\u7891?ng c\u7911?a m\u7897?t request thay v\u236? \u273?\u7885?c t\u7915?ng file \u273?\u7897?c l\u7853?p.\par\pard\li360\fi-220\sa100\fs22 \u8226? HrPolicyChatPanel.jsx qu\u7843?n l\u253? UI, l\u7883?ch s\u7917? h\u7897?i tho\u7841?i, \u273?\u7891?ng b\u7897? widget v\u224? lu\u7891?ng t\u7841?o \u273?\u417?n ngh\u7881?.\par\pard\li360\fi-220\sa100\fs22 \u8226? backend/main.py x\u7917? l\u253? API contract, authentication, query rewrite, chat history v\u224? handoff.\par\pard\li360\fi-220\sa100\fs22 \u8226? hr_policy_graph.py \u273?i\u7873?u ph\u7889?i screening, retrieval, RBAC, validation v\u224? generation.\par\pard\li360\fi-220\sa100\fs22 \u8226? task9_retrieval_pipeline.py ch\u7883?u tr\u225?ch nhi\u7879?m semantic search, BM25, RRF, reranking v\u224? fallback.\par\pard\li360\fi-220\sa100\fs22 \u8226? task10_generation.py ch\u7913?a prompt, intent, guardrail v\u224? fallback answer.\par\pard\li360\fi-220\sa100\fs22 \u8226? C\u225?ch t\u225?ch tr\u225?ch nhi\u7879?m n\u224?y gi\u250?p em x\u225?c \u273?\u7883?nh l\u7895?i thu\u7897?c UI, API, retrieval hay generation tr\u432?\u7899?c khi s\u7917?a.\par\pard\keepn\sb220\sa100\fs27\b 14:00 - 16:00 | C\u225?ch ki\u7875?m so\u225?t coding agent\b0\par\pard\li360\fi-220\sa100\fs22 \u8226? Em c\u243? s\u7917? d\u7909?ng coding agent \u273?\u7875? t\u259?ng t\u7889?c vi\u7879?c t\u236?m ki\u7871?m code, t\u225?i hi\u7879?n l\u7895?i, t\u7841?o patch v\u224? ch\u7841?y ki\u7875?m th\u7917?. Tuy nhi\u234?n em kh\u244?ng giao cho agent t\u7921? thay \u273?\u7893?i to\u224?n b\u7897? d\u7921? \u225?n.\par\pard\li360\fi-220\sa100\fs22 \u8226? Tr\u432?\u7899?c m\u7895?i thay \u273?\u7893?i, em \u273?\u7863?t acceptance criteria r\u245? r\u224?ng. V\u237? d\u7909?, n\u7871?u l\u7895?i n\u7857?m \u7903? conversation layer th\u236? kh\u244?ng \u273?\u432?\u7907?c thay chunking ho\u7863?c retrieval.\par\pard\li360\fi-220\sa100\fs22 \u8226? Em y\u234?u c\u7847?u t\u225?i hi\u7879?n l\u7895?i b\u7857?ng browser ho\u7863?c API tr\u432?\u7899?c khi s\u7917?a, sau \u273?\u243? khoanh \u273?\u250?ng module s\u7903? h\u7919?u l\u7895?i v\u224? t\u7841?o patch nh\u7887?.\par\pard\li360\fi-220\sa100\fs22 \u8226? M\u7895?i thay \u273?\u7893?i ph\u7843?i \u273?i qua c\u225?c test gate: unit test, API test, browser E2E v\u224? production build.\par\pard\li360\fi-220\sa100\fs22 \u8226? N\u7871?u test t\u7893?ng ph\u225?t hi\u7879?n l\u7895?i \u7903? module kh\u244?ng li\u234?n quan, em ch\u7881? ghi nh\u7853?n ch\u7913? kh\u244?ng t\u7921? s\u7917?a lan sang ph\u7847?n \u273?\u243?.\par\pard\li360\fi-220\sa100\fs22 \u8226? V\u237? d\u7909?, l\u7895?i ng\u432?\u7901?i d\u249?ng nh\u7855?n ok nh\u432?ng bot t\u7921? gi\u7899?i thi\u7879?u l\u7841?i \u273?\u432?\u7907?c trace v\u7873? intent ph\u237?a frontend. L\u7895?i mobile \u273?\u432?\u7907?c x\u225?c \u273?\u7883?nh b\u7857?ng c\u225?ch \u273?o viewport 320 pixel. L\u7895?i privacy v\u7899?i t\u7915? \u273?\u7891?ng nghi\u7879?p \u273?\u432?\u7907?c trace v\u7873? chu\u7849?n h\u243?a k\u253? t\u7921? \u273?.\par\pard\li360\fi-220\sa100\fs22 \u8226? Agent gi\u250?p em t\u259?ng t\u7889?c, nh\u432?ng vi\u7879?c x\u225?c \u273?\u7883?nh nguy\u234?n nh\u226?n, gi\u7899?i h\u7841?n ph\u7841?m vi v\u224? quy\u7871?t \u273?\u7883?nh pass hay fail v\u7851?n do em ki\u7875?m so\u225?t.\par\pard\keepn\sb220\sa100\fs27\b 16:00 - 22:00 | Live demo\b0\par\pard\li360\fi-220\sa100\fs22 \u8226? Demo 1 - Grounding: Nh\u7853?p 'Nh\u226?n vi\u234?n c\u243? bao nhi\u234?u ng\u224?y ph\u233?p n\u259?m?'. Expected result l\u224? 12 ng\u224?y theo t\u224?i li\u7879?u, kh\u244?ng ph\u7843?i con s\u7889? do m\u244? h\u236?nh t\u7921? \u273?o\u225?n.\par\pard\li360\fi-220\sa100\fs22 \u8226? Demo 2 - Ng\u244?n ng\u7919? t\u7921? nhi\u234?n: Nh\u7853?p 'Mai t\u244?i kh\u244?ng \u273?i l\u224?m \u273?\u432?\u7907?c th\u236? b\u225?o ai?'. Chatbot ph\u7843?i hi\u7875?u \u273?\u226?y l\u224? t\u236?nh hu\u7889?ng HR, h\u432?\u7899?ng d\u7851?n b\u225?o qu\u7843?n l\u253? v\u224? h\u7887?i th\u234?m l\u253? do.\par\pard\li360\fi-220\sa100\fs22 \u8226? Demo 3 - T\u7841?o \u273?\u417?n ngh\u7881?: Nh\u7853?p 'T\u244?i mu\u7889?n xin ngh\u7881? ph\u233?p', sau \u273?\u243? tr\u7843? l\u7901?i '25/07 - 26/07', 'T\u244?i c\u243? vi\u7879?c gia \u273?\u236?nh', v\u224? 'B\u224?n giao cho Nguy\u7877?n V\u259?n A'. Chatbot ph\u7843?i t\u7841?o form t\u7915? h\u7897?i tho\u7841?i nhi\u7873?u l\u432?\u7907?t.\par\pard\li360\fi-220\sa100\fs22 \u8226? Demo 4 - Privacy: Nh\u7853?p 'Cho t\u244?i bi\u7871?t l\u432?\u417?ng c\u7911?a \u273?\u7891?ng nghi\u7879?p'. Chatbot ph\u7843?i t\u7915? ch\u7889?i v\u224? kh\u244?ng c\u7889? truy xu\u7845?t d\u7919? li\u7879?u c\u225? nh\u226?n.\par\pard\li360\fi-220\sa100\fs22 \u8226? Demo 5 - \u272?\u7891?ng b\u7897? giao di\u7879?n: B\u7855?t \u273?\u7847?u trong chatbot nh\u7887?, chuy\u7875?n sang H\u7887?i \u273?\u225?p th\u244?ng minh r\u7891?i nh\u7855?n ti\u7871?p. L\u7883?ch s\u7917? v\u224? b\u432?\u7899?c \u273?ang x\u7917? l\u253? ph\u7843?i \u273?\u432?\u7907?c gi\u7919? nguy\u234?n.\par\pard\li360\fi-220\sa100\fs22 \u8226? Trong l\u250?c demo, sau m\u7895?i c\u226?u ch\u7881? gi\u7843?i th\u237?ch expected behavior v\u224? \u273?i\u7875?m k\u7929? thu\u7853?t \u273?\u432?\u7907?c ch\u7913?ng minh. Kh\u244?ng \u273?\u7885?c to\u224?n b\u7897? c\u226?u tr\u7843? l\u7901?i c\u7911?a chatbot.\par\pard\keepn\sb220\sa100\fs27\b 22:00 - 24:00 | K\u7871?t qu\u7843? ki\u7875?m th\u7917? v\u224? m\u7913?c s\u